    {
      "id": "find_91dee61060d14dee",
      "workspace_id": "ws_f63f244b50b7471e",
      "summary": "IAD database query p95 latency spiked ~7x during the incident window while ORD stayed flat, but the metric is an all-routes aggregate, not export-specific.",
      "detail": "db_query_p95_ms IAD: 140 ms (window 09:30-09:40), 1090 ms (09:40-09:50), 980 ms (09:50-10:00). ORD: 155 ms (09:50-10:00). All rows noted all_routes_aggregate, so this does not isolate /v1/exports and a ~1 s p95 does not by itself explain 30000 ms gateway timeouts.",
