    {
      "id": "find_b942fe68d3ec4f3d",
      "workspace_id": "ws_f63f244b50b7471e",
      "summary": "Root cause is not established: the elevated DB p95 and the 30 s upstream timeouts are correlated in time and region only; no causal evidence links them.",
      "detail": "The gateway timeout window (09:46-09:55 sampled; 09:45-10:00 aggregate) overlaps the IAD DB p95 spike (09:40-10:00), but the DB metric is all-routes aggregate, p95 ~1 s is far below the 30 s timeout, and no failed request has correlated traces. The failure could be an export-specific query tail, a downstream dependency, or another cause. Causal claims would be unsupported by current evidence.",
      "confidence": 0.8,
